  {
   "id": "unbound-worlds-apart-89597@major-2020-12-22",
   "gameId": "unbound-worlds-apart-89597",
   "displayName": "Unbound Winter Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-22T15:30:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hope you are all really well! We have been very busy working on Unbound but we think we can share some new stuff that we been working on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the demo, we had a few characters that give you about the quests. But lots of you said you want more characters as well for the lore. So we added new characters for the full game, this one is the Record Keeper. We have more, can't wait to show more in the future!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We integrated new art in the game. Here are some interesting concept arts:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, we are working on the cutscenes are well. This cutscene image could be a wallpaper:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more next year!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
